.EQ
delim $$
.EN
.PP
The sum $sum from i=1 to n i = {n(n+1)} over 2$ and the integral
$int from 0 to 1 x sup 2 dx = 1 over 3$.
.EQ
x = {-b +- sqrt {b sup 2 - 4ac}} over 2a
.EN
.EQ
left [ matrix { ccol { a above c } ccol { b above d } } right ]
~=~ ad - bc
.EN
.EQ
lim from {n -> inf} ( 1 + 1 over n ) sup n = e
.EN
.EQ
f(x) = left { lpile { 0 above x sup 2 } ~~ lpile { x < 0 above x >= 0 }
.EN
